RateLimitSigil::initializeWithMultiplexer
├── given maxActions is zero
│   └── it should revert with InvalidMaxActions
├── given windowSeconds is zero
│   └── it should revert with InvalidWindow
├── given a well-formed config
│   └── it should persist maxActions, windowSeconds, and minCooldownSeconds
└── given the instance already has running state
    └── when re-initialized
        └── it should overwrite the config but NOT reset the rolling state
